<title>JAPAN: Marche shares heavily traded on OTC market.</title>
<headline>Marche shares heavily traded on OTC market.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Marche Corp were the second most heavily traded in the other-the-counter (OTC) market on Wednesday morning. The shares were registered on the OTC market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A broker said Marche is one of a number of OTC issues which are still under-valued concerning their price-earnings ratio.</p>
<p>The shares were up 30 yen at 1,620 yen at 0159 GMT.</p>
</text>
